    <sys:String x:Key="Str_SafetyWarningTitle">Safety Warning &amp; Legal Disclaimer (Hearing Protection Notice)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_SafetyWarningDesc">【Volume Safety Rule】: Always ensure headphone/system volume is TURNED DOWN TO A LOW LEVEL before starting tests. Never present tones at high volume to prevent acoustic trauma!&#x0a;【Disclaimer &amp; Intended Use】: This tool is strictly designed for personal hearing trend monitoring and research purposes; it is not a certified medical device and carries no clinical diagnostic validity. If you experience sudden hearing decline, tinnitus, or medical concerns, immediately consult an Ear, Nose &amp; Throat (ENT) specialist.</sys:String>

